{"_type":"issue","id":"sonos-ymc","title":"Fix worker timer shim: intervals scheduled with one-shot setTimeout never re-arm - all setIntervals fire exactly once","description":"src/modules/common/timers.js worker script schedule() uses setTimeout for type=interval and timerFn does not re-arm, so every page setInterval (including the 500ms polling supervisor tick) fires once and dies. Unit tests exercise extractBody/wrapper only, so this was invisible until Playwright p3 ran the built plugin. Fix: schedule with setInterval inside the worker for type=interval. Observed: page-wide myTicks=1 after 24s; supervisor polled exactly once.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","assignee":"fable-steer","owner":"r-teller","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:49:32Z","created_by":"fable-steer","updated_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:21Z","started_at":"2026-09-06T16:49:37Z","closed_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:21Z","close_reason":"Closed","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"sonos-ymc","depends_on_id":"sonos-qif.11","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-09-06T09:49:31Z","created_by":"fable-steer","metadata":"{}"}],"comments":[{"id":"01a077a9-08a2-7ef7-80f2-19313a78b591","issue_id":"sonos-ymc","author":"fable-steer","text":"mechanic 1 round: worker schedule() uses setInterval for type=interval (was one-shot setTimeout, never re-armed). Diagnosed via page-wide interval freeze (myTicks=1 over 24s).","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:22Z"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":1}
{"_type":"issue","id":"sonos-bwx","title":"Fix sdConnect installStreamDeckBridge guard: Elgato SDK singleton pre-claims connectElgatoStreamDeckSocket global, bridge never installs","description":"The browser bundle includes @elgato/streamdeck (imported for EventEmitter per PRD 12.1); its connection singleton assigns window.connectElgatoStreamDeckSocket at module evaluation, BEFORE main.js runs installStreamDeckBridge(). The guard 'if (window.connectElgatoStreamDeckSocket) return' then early-returns, so the real bridge never installs: streamDeckReady never resolves, PluginComponent onMounted suspends forever, no lifecycle wiring, no polling. Masked in p1 because the Elgato shim sends an identical registration frame. Fix: replace the window-global guard with an internal installed flag so our bridge overwrites the SDK global; reset flag in teardownStreamDeckBridge. PRD 12.2 idempotency preserved via the flag.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","assignee":"fable-steer","owner":"r-teller","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:40:24Z","created_by":"fable-steer","updated_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:20Z","started_at":"2026-09-06T16:40:25Z","closed_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:20Z","close_reason":"Closed","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"sonos-bwx","depends_on_id":"sonos-qif.11","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-09-06T09:40:24Z","created_by":"fable-steer","metadata":"{}"}],"comments":[{"id":"01a077a9-0594-751a-a9e0-aa95289ecf89","issue_id":"sonos-bwx","author":"fable-steer","text":"mechanic 1 round: internal installed flag replaces window-global guard; teardown resets flag. Bridge now overwrites the Elgato SDK global.","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:21Z"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":1}
{"_type":"issue","id":"sonos-w9s","title":"Fix pollingSupervisor default controllerFactory: connect missing uuid breaks coordinator-routed getters","description":"Default factory was (host) =\u003e new SonosController().connect(host); transport getters (getTransportSettings/Info/PositionInfo) require boundUuid for coordinator routing and threw before any network call, so every real (non-injected-factory) poll failed. Masked in unit tests by injected factories; surfaced by Playwright p3 against the built bundle. Fix: factory signature (host, uuid) =\u003e connect(host, { uuid }); pollSpeaker passes UUID. PRD adjudication: §11.3 snippet omits uuid but §11.3 acceptance (7-getter fan-out succeeds) + §10 routing contract require it.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"bug","assignee":"fable-steer","owner":"r-teller","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:28:09Z","created_by":"fable-steer","updated_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:20Z","started_at":"2026-09-06T16:28:26Z","closed_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:20Z","close_reason":"Closed","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"sonos-w9s","depends_on_id":"sonos-qif.11","type":"discovered-from","created_at":"2026-09-06T09:28:09Z","created_by":"fable-steer","metadata":"{}"}],"comments":[{"id":"01a077a9-027b-7436-bc8c-0ee78aeebf46","issue_id":"sonos-w9s","author":"fable-steer","text":"mechanic 1 round: factory (host, uuid) =\u003e connect(host, { uuid }); pollSpeaker passes UUID; 1 unit assertion updated.","created_at":"2026-09-06T16:59:20Z"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":1}
